<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's SFE wheat futures ease in thin trade.</title>
<headline>Australia's SFE wheat futures ease in thin trade.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney Futures Exchange (SFE) wheat futures eased on Thursday in thin trade that contrasted with the active business seen on Wednesday and Tuesday.</p>
<p>The January 1998 contract was the only one to trade, falling by 50 cents a tonne to A$167.50 on a volume of just lots.</p>
